{"unit_id":"SOH4C4759__dsh-ui-sound#feature-1","repo":"SOH4C4759/dsh-ui-sound","commit":"a54bc32d8e4810c8ae5d68b47086b535d8438dea","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-ui-sound 的功能「交互分类提示音」：按下普通、主要、开关、发送、关闭、危险操作或链接时播放对应提示；支持指针操作和键盘激活，并可在设置中关闭按钮音。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:230-250","lib/client.js:537-576"]}
{"unit_id":"SOH4C4759__dsh-ui-sound#feature-2","repo":"SOH4C4759/dsh-ui-sound","commit":"a54bc32d8e4810c8ae5d68b47086b535d8438dea","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-ui-sound 的功能「会话运行状态音」：监听当前查看的会话，在运行开始、成功结束或失败结束时播放对应情景音；首轮观察只建立基线，不补播开始音。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:461-488"]}
{"unit_id":"SOH4C4759__dsh-ui-sound#feature-3","repo":"SOH4C4759/dsh-ui-sound","commit":"a54bc32d8e4810c8ae5d68b47086b535d8438dea","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-ui-sound 的功能「待处理交互提醒」：会话出现待处理交互时播放提醒音，并提供独立的提醒音开关；提醒检测可等待 uiSession 服务注册。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:491-533"]}
{"unit_id":"SOH4C4759__dsh-ui-sound#feature-4","repo":"SOH4C4759/dsh-ui-sound","commit":"a54bc32d8e4810c8ae5d68b47086b535d8438dea","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-ui-sound 的功能「音效设置与持久化」：在设置页调整总开关、音量、音色包和各情景 cue；Host API 将偏好保存到本地配置文件。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:175-220","lib/index.js:217-223","lib/index.js:378-385"]}
{"unit_id":"SOH4C4759__dsh-ui-sound#caveat-1","repo":"SOH4C4759/dsh-ui-sound","commit":"a54bc32d8e4810c8ae5d68b47086b535d8438dea","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-ui-sound 使用浏览器 Web Audio；首次页面手势前不能解锁音频，因此最初一次交互可能没有声音。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:557-576"]}
